Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.78,0:00:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,蓝色监狱，加时
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.58,0:00:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我的饺子耶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.38,0:00:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,是我牙丸，你在学我牙丸
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.06,0:00:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,答对了\N有够像
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.70,0:00:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.22,0:00:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,模仿队友大赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.46,0:00:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,好了，接着轮到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.14,0:00:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不惜背叛也要赢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.10,0:00:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦了，Ｚ队
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.58,0:00:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,是久远…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.86,0:00:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,答对了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.18,0:00:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦啰\N太会了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.82,0:00:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那谁都能学得像吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.82,0:00:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,接着换千切了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.98,0:00:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我就免了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.14,0:00:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,快点啦，交给你了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.82,0:00:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶，大小姐首次模仿秀
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.14,0:00:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我想想…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.18,0:00:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,如果想玩友情游戏就滚吧\N滚回去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.74,0:00:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,冠军诞生
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.30,0:00:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,甘拜下风，大小姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.46,0:00:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,滚回去…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
